{"book":"daxue","id":"sishu.daxue.01","index":1,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.01.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"dà","traditional":"大","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"学","pinyin":"xué","traditional":"學","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zài","traditional":"在","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zài","traditional":"在","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"亲","pinyin":"qīn","traditional":"親","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mín","traditional":"民","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zài","traditional":"在","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhǐ","traditional":"止","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shàn","traditional":"善","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Adapun Jalan Suci yang dibawakan Ajaran Besar — Da Xue - Thai Hak ini, ialah; menggemilangkan Kebajikan Yang Bercahaya — Mingde (Bing Tik), mengasihi rakyat, dan berhenti pada Puncak Kebaikan."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.01.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhǐ","traditional":"止","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dìng","traditional":"定","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"dìng","traditional":"定","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"静","pinyin":"jìng","traditional":"靜","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"静","pinyin":"jìng","traditional":"靜","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ān","traditional":"安","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"ān","traditional":"安","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"虑","pinyin":"lǜ","traditional":"慮","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"虑","pinyin":"lǜ","traditional":"慮","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"得","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Bila sudah diketahui Tempat Hentian, akan diperoleh Ketetapan (Tujuan); setelah diperoleh Ketetapan, baharulah dapat dirasakan Ketenteraman; setelah Tenteram, baharulah dapat dicapai Kesentosaan (Bathin); setelah Sentosa, baharulah dapat Berfikir Benar; dan dengan Berfikir Benar, baharulah orang dapat Berhasil."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.01.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"běn","traditional":"本","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mò","traditional":"末","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"事","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"终","pinyin":"zhōng","traditional":"終","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shǐ","traditional":"始","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xiān","traditional":"先","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","p